---
layout: inner.njk
title: "Новини — Ритеил парк Раковски"
description: "Последни новини и обяви от Ритеил парк Раковски."
---

<section class="relative bg-white/80 pt-28 sm:pt-32 pb-20 sm:pb-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6">

    {# ── Editorial header ── #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-12 items-end mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <div class="lg:col-span-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="h-px w-10 bg-brand-yellow"></span>
          <span class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.32em] uppercase text-brand-yellow">Новини</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.05]">
          Последни новини
          <span class="block italic font-light text-slate-900">
            <span class="underline decoration-brand-yellow decoration-[3px] underline-offset-[10px]">и събития</span>.
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          Актуално от парка — откривания, нови партньори, промени в работно време и полезни съобщения за посетители.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {# ── News cards grid (same pattern as homepage) ── #}
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for post in news.items %}
      <article class="news-card relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl bg-white shadow-lg shadow-black/10 ring-1 ring-slate-200/60">
        <div class="news-card__media relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="{{ post.image | url }}"
            alt="{{ post.title }}"
            class="news-card__img absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/55 via-transparent to-transparent opacity-70" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white/95 px-3 py-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-wide text-slate-900 shadow-sm backdrop-blur-sm">
            <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow"></span>
            {{ post.date }}
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="relative px-6 pb-7 pt-2 sm:p-7">
          <span
            class="news-card__accent absolute left-6 top-0 h-px w-10 -translate-y-px bg-brand-yellow sm:left-7"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></span>
          <h2 class="news-card__title mt-5 text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold leading-snug tracking-tight text-slate-900">
            {{ post.title }}
          </h2>
          <p class="rich-content mt-3 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
            {{ post.excerpt | safe }}
          </p>
          <a
            href="{{ post.url | url }}"
            class="news-card__link mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800"
          >
            Прочети повече
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l5 5a1 1 0 010 1.414l-5 5a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L11.586 10 7.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
